title: Analytics › Read-only cards: payers, draft edits, what helps most
route: /analytics
intro: Three cards you read but cannot click: the payer bars, the draft-edit donut and the ranked list of what helps most. There are no tooltips on hover and nothing opens on a click. They change only with the period and payer menus.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: 'not enough decisions' on the bars and the donut cannot happen with the demo's numbers. On 'What helps most' it can, for one payer.
---
start s1 "Scroll to the cards"

group gBars "Card 'Approval rate by payer'"
  screen b1 "'Approved as asked, this quarter'\nBars, best first: Lakeshore 86%, Beacon PPO 81%, Harborview MA 77%, Summit Medicaid 74%, Evergreen 69%, Cardinal 63%"
  decision b2 "Rate band?"
  process b3 "80 and above: green bar"
  process b4 "55 to 79: ochre bar"
  process b5 "Below 55: terracotta bar"
  screen b6 "Footnote '1,070 decisions this quarter. Green is 80 and above, ochre 55 to 79, terracotta below 55.'"
  decision b7 "A payer is chosen in the menu?"
  process b8 "Two bars: that payer, then 'All payers' for comparison"
endgroup

group gEdit "Card 'How people edit agent drafts'"
  screen d1 "'Share of drafts, this quarter'\nDonut with '68%' and 'as written' in the middle"
  screen d2 "Legend\n'Sent as written' 68% · approved 89% of the time\n'Light edits' 27% · approved 76%\n'Rewritten' 5% · approved 45%"
  screen d3 "'966 drafts this quarter.'"
  decision d4 "Fewer than 20 drafts?\n(no demo view gets here)"
  screen d5 "'Not enough decisions yet. Figures based on fewer than 20 decisions stay hidden.'"
endgroup

group gHelp "Card 'What helps most'"
  screen h1 "'Steps taken most often, and how often those requests were approved'"
  screen h2 "Up to four rows, ranked 1 to 4\nStep name, 'Applied 389 times', '91% approved' in green"
  process h3 "Top four this quarter: dated depression scores 91%, appeal partial unit approvals 88%, name the step-down provider 85%, file recertification 72 hours early 83%"
  decision h4 "Any step applied 20 or more times for this payer?"
  screen h5 "'Not enough decisions yet. Figures based on fewer than 20 decisions stay hidden.'"
endgroup

process p1 "Hover and click do nothing on bars, donut slices, legend and list rows"
end e1 "Cards read"
endx e2 "No drill-down: rows are not links"

s1 --> b1 & d1 & h1
b1 --> b2
b2 -->|80 and above| b3 --> b6
b2 -->|55 to 79| b4 --> b6
b2 -->|Below 55| b5 --> b6
b6 --> b7
b7 -->|Yes| b8 --> e1
b7 -->|No| e1
d1 --> d2 --> d3 --> d4
d4 -->|No| e1
d4 -->|Yes| d5 --> e1
h1 --> h2 --> h3 --> h4
h4 -->|Yes| e1
h4 -->|No| h5 --> e1
s1 -.-> p1 --> e2
